    <summary type="text">I&#39;m starting to setup litestream for replicating sqlite dbs of my apps to my self-hosted MinIO instance... only issue is</summary>
    <content type="html">&lt;a href=&#34;https://community.fly.io/t/static-egress-ips-for-machines/22004&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img&#xA;        src=&#34;https://shots.wayl.one/shot/?url=https://community.fly.io/t/static-egress-ips-for-machines/22004&amp;height=450&amp;width=800&amp;scaled_width=800&amp;scaled_height=450&amp;selectors=&#34;&#xA;        alt=&#34;shot of post - Static egress IPs for machines - Fresh Produce - Fly.io&#34;&#xA;        height=450&#xA;        width=800&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Here&amp;rsquo;s my thought on &lt;a href=&#34;https://community.fly.io/t/static-egress-ips-for-machines/22004&#34;&gt;Static egress IPs for machines - Fresh Produce - Fly.io&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m starting to setup &lt;a href=&#34;/litestream/&#34; class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; title=&#34;Litestream is a simple way to replicate SQLite databases&#34; data-hover-title=&#34;Litestream&#34;&gt;litestream&lt;/a&gt; for replicating sqlite dbs of my apps to my self-hosted MinIO instance&amp;hellip; only issue is most of my networking assumes client connectivity via tailscale so I whitelist pretty much every accessible domain.&#xA;This has gotten me in trouble once or twice, and I&amp;rsquo;m currently in the throws of backing up sqlite from fly.io. The easiest solution for me would be to add egress IP cidr blocks to my traefik whitelisting configuration and wouldn&amp;rsquo;t ya know it - in september 2024 fly.io released the ability to set static egress IPs!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;admonition note&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;admonition-title&#34;&gt;Note&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This is one of [[ my-thoughts ]]. I picked this up from &lt;a href=&#34;https://waylonwalker.com&#34;&gt;Waylon Walker&lt;/a&gt;(&lt;a href=&#34;https://thoughts.waylonwalker.com&#34;&gt;https://thoughts.waylonwalker.com&lt;/a&gt;). It&amp;rsquo;s a short note that I make about someone else&amp;rsquo;s content online.  Learn more about the process &lt;a href=&#34;/thoughts/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Thoughts&#34; data-description=&#34;My thoughts are found at my thoughts feed&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-06-09&#34; data-preview=&#34;My thoughts are found at my thoughts feed&#34;&gt;Thoughts&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;</content>
